## Bundled binaries

The Windows installers ship prebuilt binaries in `src-tauri/sidecars/` so Veridicus can compile PDFs and
read them back without a system toolchain. They are redistributed unmodified and invoked as separate
processes; Veridicus does not link against them or patch them.

