| Poppler | 26.09.0 | `pdftoppm.exe`, `pdftotext.exe`, `poppler.dll` | https://poppler.freedesktop.org/ | GNU GPL, version 2 |
| poppler support libraries | as built upstream | `freetype.dll`, `icudt78.dll`, `icuuc78.dll`, `jpeg8.dll`, `lcms2.dll`, `Lerc.dll`, `libcrypto-3-x64.dll`, `libcurl.dll`, `liblzma.dll`, `libpng16.dll`, `libssh2.dll`, `openjp2.dll`, `psl-5.dll`, `tiff.dll`, `deflate.dll`, `zlib.dll`, `zstd.dll` | each project, linked upstream | each library's own licence (GNU GPL or LGPL, MIT, BSD, Apache-2.0, zlib and public-domain terms among them) |
