## Typst

Typst is distributed under the Apache License 2.0 with a NOTICE file, and section 4(d) of that licence
requires the notice to travel with the binary. The upstream notice is included verbatim as
`src-tauri/sidecars/NOTICE-typst.txt` and is installed next to `typst.exe`, so it ships inside every
installer built from this repository.

## Poppler

Poppler and the GNU-licensed libraries beside it are distributed under the GNU General Public License.
The licence text shipped by Poppler is included as `src-tauri/sidecars/COPYING-poppler.txt` and is
installed next to the binaries.

The binaries are the upstream project's own builds, unmodified. Source for the exact versions is
available from https://poppler.freedesktop.org/ and from each support library's project. If you need
the corresponding source for the binaries in a particular release of Veridicus and cannot obtain it
upstream, open an issue at https://github.com/RadioMan18/Veridicus/issues and it will be provided.

